{
  "book": "alma",
  "bookName": "Alma",
  "chapter": 37,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 765.979,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.765,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, my son Helaman,",
      "verse": "37:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 1.945,
      "end": 5.985,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I command you that ye take the records which have been entrusted with me;",
      "verse": "37:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 6.665,
      "end": 10.612,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I also command you that ye keep a record of this people,",
      "verse": "37:2",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 10.792,
      "end": 13.671,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "according as I have done, upon the plates of Nephi,",
      "verse": "37:2",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 13.851,
      "end": 17.288,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and keep all these things sacred which I have kept,",
      "verse": "37:2",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 17.468,
      "end": 19.186,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even as I have kept them;",
      "verse": "37:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 19.366,
      "end": 22.245,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for it is for a wise purpose that they are kept.",
      "verse": "37:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 22.925,
      "end": 24.69,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And these plates of brass,",
      "verse": "37:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 24.87,
      "end": 26.867,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which contain these engravings,",
      "verse": "37:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 27.047,
      "end": 30.576,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which have the records of the holy scriptures upon them,",
      "verse": "37:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 30.756,
      "end": 33.682,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which have the genealogy of our forefathers,",
      "verse": "37:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 33.862,
      "end": 35.534,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even from the beginning\u2014",
      "verse": "37:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 36.214,
      "end": 39.186,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, it has been prophesied by our fathers,",
      "verse": "37:4",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 39.366,
      "end": 40.899,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they should be kept",
      "verse": "37:4",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 41.079,
      "end": 44.19,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and handed down from one generation to another,",
      "verse": "37:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 44.37,
      "end": 47.11,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and be kept and preserved by the hand of the Lord",
      "verse": "37:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 47.29,
      "end": 52.352,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "until they should go forth unto every nation, kindred, tongue, and people,",
      "verse": "37:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 52.532,
      "end": 55.876,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they shall know of the mysteries contained thereon.",
      "verse": "37:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 56.556,
      "end": 60.968,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now behold, if they are kept they must retain their brightness;",
      "verse": "37:5",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 61.148,
      "end": 63.888,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and they will retain their brightness;",
      "verse": "37:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 64.068,
      "end": 68.805,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and also shall all the plates which do contain that which is holy writ.",
      "verse": "37:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 69.485,
      "end": 72.596,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now ye may suppose that this is foolishness in me;",
      "verse": "37:6",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 72.776,
      "end": 79.417,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but behold I say unto you, that by small and simple things are great things brought to pass;",
      "verse": "37:6",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 79.597,
      "end": 83.08,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and small means in many instances doth confound the wise.",
      "verse": "37:6",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 83.76,
      "end": 88.776,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the Lord God doth work by means to bring about his great and eternal purposes;",
      "verse": "37:7",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 88.956,
      "end": 92.485,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and by very small means the Lord doth confound the wise",
      "verse": "37:7",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 92.665,
      "end": 95.776,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and bringeth about the salvation of many souls.",
      "verse": "37:7",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 96.456,
      "end": 99.8,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, it has hitherto been wisdom in God",
      "verse": "37:8",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 99.98,
      "end": 102.163,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that these things should be preserved;",
      "verse": "37:8",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 102.343,
      "end": 106.337,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, they have enlarged the memory of this people,",
      "verse": "37:8",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 106.517,
      "end": 109.907,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and convinced many of the error of their ways,",
      "verse": "37:8",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 110.087,
      "end": 114.638,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and brought them to the knowledge of their God unto the salvation of their souls.",
      "verse": "37:8",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 115.318,
      "end": 116.804,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, I say unto you,",
      "verse": "37:9",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 116.984,
      "end": 120.885,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "were it not for these things that these records do contain,",
      "verse": "37:9",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 121.065,
      "end": 122.83,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which are on these plates,",
      "verse": "37:9",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 123.01,
      "end": 131.323,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Ammon and his brethren could not have convinced so many thousands of the Lamanites of the incorrect tradition of their fathers;",
      "verse": "37:9",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 131.503,
      "end": 135.59,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, these records and their words brought them unto repentance;",
      "verse": "37:9",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 135.77,
      "end": 139.717,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that is, they brought them to the knowledge of the Lord their God,",
      "verse": "37:9",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 139.897,
      "end": 142.916,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to rejoice in Jesus Christ their Redeemer.",
      "verse": "37:9",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 143.596,
      "end": 148.565,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And who knoweth but what they will be the means of bringing many thousands of them,",
      "verse": "37:10",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 148.745,
      "end": 153.296,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and also many thousands of our stiffnecked brethren, the Nephites,",
      "verse": "37:10",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 153.476,
      "end": 159.002,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who are now hardening their hearts in sin and iniquities, to the knowledge of their Redeemer?",
      "verse": "37:10",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 159.682,
      "end": 163.165,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now these mysteries are not yet fully made known unto me;",
      "verse": "37:11",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 163.345,
      "end": 165.249,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore I shall forbear.",
      "verse": "37:11",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 165.929,
      "end": 168.205,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it may suffice if I only say",
      "verse": "37:12",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 168.385,
      "end": 170.893,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they are preserved for a wise purpose,",
      "verse": "37:12",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 171.073,
      "end": 173.441,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which purpose is known unto God;",
      "verse": "37:12",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 173.621,
      "end": 176.872,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he doth counsel in wisdom over all his works,",
      "verse": "37:12",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 177.052,
      "end": 178.91,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his paths are straight,",
      "verse": "37:12",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 179.09,
      "end": 181.644,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his course is one eternal round.",
      "verse": "37:12",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 182.324,
      "end": 184.739,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O remember, remember, my son Helaman,",
      "verse": "37:13",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 184.919,
      "end": 187.195,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "how strict are the commandments of God.",
      "verse": "37:13",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 187.375,
      "end": 188.675,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he said:",
      "verse": "37:13",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 188.855,
      "end": 192.384,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "If ye will keep my commandments ye shall prosper in the land\u2014",
      "verse": "37:13",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 192.564,
      "end": 196.697,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but if ye keep not his commandments ye shall be cut off from his presence.",
      "verse": "37:13",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 197.377,
      "end": 203.461,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now remember, my son, that God has entrusted you with these things, which are sacred,",
      "verse": "37:14",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 203.641,
      "end": 205.359,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which he has kept sacred,",
      "verse": "37:14",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 205.539,
      "end": 209.997,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also which he will keep and preserve for a wise purpose in him,",
      "verse": "37:14",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 210.177,
      "end": 214.124,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he may show forth his power unto future generations.",
      "verse": "37:14",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 214.804,
      "end": 218.241,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now behold, I tell you by the spirit of prophecy,",
      "verse": "37:15",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 218.421,
      "end": 221.115,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that if ye transgress the commandments of God,",
      "verse": "37:15",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 221.295,
      "end": 223.663,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, these things which are sacred",
      "verse": "37:15",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 223.843,
      "end": 227.047,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall be taken away from you by the power of God,",
      "verse": "37:15",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 227.227,
      "end": 229.735,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ye shall be delivered up unto Satan,",
      "verse": "37:15",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 229.915,
      "end": 232.748,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he may sift you as chaff before the wind.",
      "verse": "37:15",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 233.428,
      "end": 235.889,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But if ye keep the commandments of God,",
      "verse": "37:16",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 236.069,
      "end": 241.642,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and do with these things which are sacred according to that which the Lord doth command you,",
      "verse": "37:16",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 241.822,
      "end": 244.098,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "(for you must appeal unto the Lord",
      "verse": "37:16",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 244.278,
      "end": 247.25,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for all things whatsoever ye must do with them)",
      "verse": "37:16",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 247.43,
      "end": 251.052,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, no power of earth or hell can take them from you,",
      "verse": "37:16",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 251.232,
      "end": 254.622,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for God is powerful to the fulfilling of all his words.",
      "verse": "37:16",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 255.302,
      "end": 258.878,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For he will fulfil all his promises which he shall make unto you,",
      "verse": "37:17",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 259.058,
      "end": 263.748,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he has fulfilled his promises which he has made unto our fathers.",
      "verse": "37:17",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 264.428,
      "end": 270.512,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For he promised unto them that he would preserve these things for a wise purpose in him,",
      "verse": "37:18",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 270.692,
      "end": 274.361,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he might show forth his power unto future generations.",
      "verse": "37:18",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 275.041,
      "end": 278.106,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now behold, one purpose hath he fulfilled,",
      "verse": "37:19",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 278.286,
      "end": 283.627,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even to the restoration of many thousands of the Lamanites to the knowledge of the truth;",
      "verse": "37:19",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 283.807,
      "end": 286.408,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he hath shown forth his power in them,",
      "verse": "37:19",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 286.588,
      "end": 291.696,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he will also still show forth his power in them unto future generations;",
      "verse": "37:19",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 291.876,
      "end": 294.291,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they shall be preserved.",
      "verse": "37:19",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 294.971,
      "end": 297.665,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore I command you, my son Helaman,",
      "verse": "37:20",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 297.845,
      "end": 300.864,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye be diligent in fulfilling all my words,",
      "verse": "37:20",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 301.044,
      "end": 305.967,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that ye be diligent in keeping the commandments of God as they are written.",
      "verse": "37:20",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 306.647,
      "end": 311.988,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, I will speak unto you concerning those twenty-four plates, that ye keep them,",
      "verse": "37:21",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 312.168,
      "end": 315.605,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the mysteries and the works of darkness,",
      "verse": "37:21",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 315.785,
      "end": 320.801,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their secret works, or the secret works of those people who have been destroyed,",
      "verse": "37:21",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 320.981,
      "end": 323.442,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "may be made manifest unto this people;",
      "verse": "37:21",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 323.622,
      "end": 326.919,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, all their murders, and robbings, and their plunderings,",
      "verse": "37:21",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 327.099,
      "end": 331.975,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all their wickedness and abominations, may be made manifest unto this people;",
      "verse": "37:21",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 332.155,
      "end": 334.988,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and that ye preserve these interpreters.",
      "verse": "37:21",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 335.668,
      "end": 340.219,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, the Lord saw that his people began to work in darkness,",
      "verse": "37:22",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 340.399,
      "end": 343.325,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, work secret murders and abominations;",
      "verse": "37:22",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 343.505,
      "end": 344.991,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore the Lord said,",
      "verse": "37:22",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 345.171,
      "end": 346.843,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if they did not repent",
      "verse": "37:22",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 347.023,
      "end": 350.227,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they should be destroyed from off the face of the earth.",
      "verse": "37:22",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 350.907,
      "end": 352.486,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the Lord said:",
      "verse": "37:23",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 352.666,
      "end": 358.425,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will prepare unto my servant Gazelem, a stone, which shall shine forth in darkness unto light,",
      "verse": "37:23",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 358.605,
      "end": 361.484,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I may discover unto my people who serve me,",
      "verse": "37:23",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 361.664,
      "end": 365.24,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I may discover unto them the works of their brethren,",
      "verse": "37:23",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 365.42,
      "end": 368.671,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, their secret works, their works of darkness,",
      "verse": "37:23",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 368.851,
      "end": 371.266,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their wickedness and abominations.",
      "verse": "37:23",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 371.946,
      "end": 374.825,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, my son, these interpreters were prepared",
      "verse": "37:24",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 375.005,
      "end": 377.466,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the word of God might be fulfilled,",
      "verse": "37:24",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 377.646,
      "end": 379.364,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which he spake, saying:",
      "verse": "37:24",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 380.044,
      "end": 383.109,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will bring forth out of darkness unto light",
      "verse": "37:25",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 383.289,
      "end": 386.122,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "all their secret works and their abominations;",
      "verse": "37:25",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 386.302,
      "end": 390.76,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and except they repent I will destroy them from off the face of the earth;",
      "verse": "37:25",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 390.94,
      "end": 394.795,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I will bring to light all their secrets and abominations,",
      "verse": "37:25",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 394.975,
      "end": 398.365,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "unto every nation that shall hereafter possess the land.",
      "verse": "37:25",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 399.045,
      "end": 400.438,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, my son,",
      "verse": "37:26",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 400.618,
      "end": 402.801,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "we see that they did not repent;",
      "verse": "37:26",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 402.981,
      "end": 405.257,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they have been destroyed,",
      "verse": "37:26",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 405.437,
      "end": 408.363,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus far the word of God has been fulfilled;",
      "verse": "37:26",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 408.543,
      "end": 413.187,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, their secret abominations have been brought out of darkness",
      "verse": "37:26",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 413.367,
      "end": 414.807,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and made known unto us.",
      "verse": "37:26",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 415.487,
      "end": 417.391,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, my son, I command you",
      "verse": "37:27",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 417.571,
      "end": 420.961,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye retain all their oaths, and their covenants,",
      "verse": "37:27",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 421.141,
      "end": 424.624,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their agreements in their secret abominations;",
      "verse": "37:27",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 424.804,
      "end": 429.169,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and all their signs and their wonders ye shall keep from this people,",
      "verse": "37:27",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 429.349,
      "end": 431.253,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they know them not,",
      "verse": "37:27",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 431.433,
      "end": 435.984,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "lest peradventure they should fall into darkness also and be destroyed.",
      "verse": "37:27",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 436.664,
      "end": 439.868,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, there is a curse upon all this land,",
      "verse": "37:28",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 440.048,
      "end": 447.014,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that destruction shall come upon all those workers of darkness, according to the power of God,",
      "verse": "37:28",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 447.194,
      "end": 449.052,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when they are fully ripe;",
      "verse": "37:28",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 449.232,
      "end": 452.529,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore I desire that this people might not be destroyed.",
      "verse": "37:28",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 453.209,
      "end": 454.881,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore ye shall keep",
      "verse": "37:29",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 455.061,
      "end": 459.937,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "these secret plans of their oaths and their covenants from this people,",
      "verse": "37:29",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 460.117,
      "end": 464.622,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and only their wickedness and their murders and their abominations",
      "verse": "37:29",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 464.802,
      "end": 472.0,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall ye make known unto them; and ye shall teach them to abhor such wickedness and abominations and murders;",
      "verse": "37:29",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 472.18,
      "end": 481.282,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and ye shall also teach them that these people were destroyed on account of their wickedness and abominations and their murders.",
      "verse": "37:29",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 481.962,
      "end": 485.12,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, they murdered all the prophets of the Lord",
      "verse": "37:30",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 485.3,
      "end": 489.99,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who came among them to declare unto them concerning their iniquities;",
      "verse": "37:30",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 490.17,
      "end": 495.139,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the blood of those whom they murdered did cry unto the Lord their God",
      "verse": "37:30",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 495.319,
      "end": 498.57,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for vengeance upon those who were their murderers;",
      "verse": "37:30",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 498.75,
      "end": 505.066,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thus the judgments of God did come upon these workers of darkness and secret combinations.",
      "verse": "37:30",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 505.746,
      "end": 513.734,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and cursed be the land forever and ever unto those workers of darkness and secret combinations, even unto destruction,",
      "verse": "37:31",
      "lineIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "start": 513.914,
      "end": 517.397,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "except they repent before they are fully ripe.",
      "verse": "37:31",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 518.077,
      "end": 519.47,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, my son,",
      "verse": "37:32",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 519.65,
      "end": 522.483,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "remember the words which I have spoken unto you;",
      "verse": "37:32",
      "lineIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "start": 522.663,
      "end": 525.867,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "trust not those secret plans unto this people,",
      "verse": "37:32",
      "lineIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "start": 526.047,
      "end": 530.18,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but teach them an everlasting hatred against sin and iniquity.",
      "verse": "37:32",
      "lineIndex": 143
    },
    {
      "start": 530.86,
      "end": 535.132,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Preach unto them repentance, and faith on the Lord Jesus Christ;",
      "verse": "37:33",
      "lineIndex": 145
    },
    {
      "start": 535.312,
      "end": 539.677,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "teach them to humble themselves and to be meek and lowly in heart;",
      "verse": "37:33",
      "lineIndex": 146
    },
    {
      "start": 539.857,
      "end": 546.777,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "teach them to withstand every temptation of the devil, with their faith on the Lord Jesus Christ.",
      "verse": "37:33",
      "lineIndex": 147
    },
    {
      "start": 547.457,
      "end": 550.151,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Teach them to never be weary of good works,",
      "verse": "37:34",
      "lineIndex": 148
    },
    {
      "start": 550.331,
      "end": 552.932,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but to be meek and lowly in heart;",
      "verse": "37:34",
      "lineIndex": 149
    },
    {
      "start": 553.112,
      "end": 555.527,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for such shall find rest to their souls.",
      "verse": "37:34",
      "lineIndex": 150
    },
    {
      "start": 556.207,
      "end": 557.786,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O, remember, my son,",
      "verse": "37:35",
      "lineIndex": 151
    },
    {
      "start": 557.966,
      "end": 560.242,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and learn wisdom in thy youth;",
      "verse": "37:35",
      "lineIndex": 152
    },
    {
      "start": 560.422,
      "end": 563.626,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, learn in thy youth to keep the commandments of God.",
      "verse": "37:35",
      "lineIndex": 153
    },
    {
      "start": 564.306,
      "end": 566.953,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and cry unto God for all thy support;",
      "verse": "37:36",
      "lineIndex": 154
    },
    {
      "start": 567.133,
      "end": 569.827,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, let all thy doings be unto the Lord,",
      "verse": "37:36",
      "lineIndex": 155
    },
    {
      "start": 570.007,
      "end": 572.143,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and whithersoever thou goest",
      "verse": "37:36",
      "lineIndex": 156
    },
    {
      "start": 572.323,
      "end": 573.856,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "let it be in the Lord;",
      "verse": "37:36",
      "lineIndex": 157
    },
    {
      "start": 574.036,
      "end": 577.798,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, let all thy thoughts be directed unto the Lord;",
      "verse": "37:36",
      "lineIndex": 158
    },
    {
      "start": 577.978,
      "end": 582.297,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, let the affections of thy heart be placed upon the Lord forever.",
      "verse": "37:36",
      "lineIndex": 159
    },
    {
      "start": 582.977,
      "end": 585.345,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Counsel with the Lord in all thy doings,",
      "verse": "37:37",
      "lineIndex": 160
    },
    {
      "start": 585.525,
      "end": 587.522,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he will direct thee for good;",
      "verse": "37:37",
      "lineIndex": 161
    },
    {
      "start": 587.702,
      "end": 591.324,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, when thou liest down at night lie down unto the Lord,",
      "verse": "37:37",
      "lineIndex": 162
    },
    {
      "start": 591.504,
      "end": 593.919,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he may watch over you in your sleep;",
      "verse": "37:37",
      "lineIndex": 163
    },
    {
      "start": 594.099,
      "end": 596.467,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and when thou risest in the morning",
      "verse": "37:37",
      "lineIndex": 164
    },
    {
      "start": 596.647,
      "end": 599.248,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "let thy heart be full of thanks unto God;",
      "verse": "37:37",
      "lineIndex": 165
    },
    {
      "start": 599.428,
      "end": 601.007,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and if ye do these things,",
      "verse": "37:37",
      "lineIndex": 166
    },
    {
      "start": 601.187,
      "end": 603.416,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye shall be lifted up at the last day.",
      "verse": "37:37",
      "lineIndex": 167
    },
    {
      "start": 604.096,
      "end": 605.489,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, my son,",
      "verse": "37:38",
      "lineIndex": 169
    },
    {
      "start": 605.669,
      "end": 612.031,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I have somewhat to say concerning the thing which our fathers call a ball, or director\u2014",
      "verse": "37:38",
      "lineIndex": 170
    },
    {
      "start": 612.211,
      "end": 614.765,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or our fathers called it Liahona,",
      "verse": "37:38",
      "lineIndex": 171
    },
    {
      "start": 614.945,
      "end": 617.685,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which is, being interpreted, a compass;",
      "verse": "37:38",
      "lineIndex": 172
    },
    {
      "start": 617.865,
      "end": 619.305,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the Lord prepared it.",
      "verse": "37:38",
      "lineIndex": 173
    },
    {
      "start": 619.985,
      "end": 622.214,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, there cannot any man",
      "verse": "37:39",
      "lineIndex": 174
    },
    {
      "start": 622.394,
      "end": 625.645,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "work after the manner of so curious a workmanship.",
      "verse": "37:39",
      "lineIndex": 175
    },
    {
      "start": 625.825,
      "end": 632.652,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, it was prepared to show unto our fathers the course which they should travel in the wilderness.",
      "verse": "37:39",
      "lineIndex": 176
    },
    {
      "start": 633.332,
      "end": 636.443,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it did work for them according to their faith in God;",
      "verse": "37:40",
      "lineIndex": 177
    },
    {
      "start": 636.623,
      "end": 643.914,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, if they had faith to believe that God could cause that those spindles should point the way they should go,",
      "verse": "37:40",
      "lineIndex": 178
    },
    {
      "start": 644.094,
      "end": 645.766,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold, it was done;",
      "verse": "37:40",
      "lineIndex": 179
    },
    {
      "start": 645.946,
      "end": 649.94,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore they had this miracle, and also many other miracles",
      "verse": "37:40",
      "lineIndex": 180
    },
    {
      "start": 650.12,
      "end": 652.488,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wrought by the power of God, day by day.",
      "verse": "37:40",
      "lineIndex": 181
    },
    {
      "start": 653.168,
      "end": 657.069,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Nevertheless, because those miracles were worked by small means",
      "verse": "37:41",
      "lineIndex": 182
    },
    {
      "start": 657.249,
      "end": 659.757,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "it did show unto them marvelous works.",
      "verse": "37:41",
      "lineIndex": 183
    },
    {
      "start": 659.937,
      "end": 661.516,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "They were slothful,",
      "verse": "37:41",
      "lineIndex": 184
    },
    {
      "start": 661.696,
      "end": 664.947,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and forgot to exercise their faith and diligence",
      "verse": "37:41",
      "lineIndex": 185
    },
    {
      "start": 665.127,
      "end": 667.774,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and then those marvelous works ceased,",
      "verse": "37:41",
      "lineIndex": 186
    },
    {
      "start": 667.954,
      "end": 670.276,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did not progress in their journey;",
      "verse": "37:41",
      "lineIndex": 187
    },
    {
      "start": 670.956,
      "end": 673.464,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, they tarried in the wilderness,",
      "verse": "37:42",
      "lineIndex": 188
    },
    {
      "start": 673.644,
      "end": 675.92,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or did not travel a direct course,",
      "verse": "37:42",
      "lineIndex": 189
    },
    {
      "start": 676.1,
      "end": 680.512,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and were afflicted with hunger and thirst, because of their transgressions.",
      "verse": "37:42",
      "lineIndex": 190
    },
    {
      "start": 681.192,
      "end": 682.585,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, my son,",
      "verse": "37:43",
      "lineIndex": 191
    },
    {
      "start": 682.765,
      "end": 687.13,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I would that ye should understand that these things are not without a shadow;",
      "verse": "37:43",
      "lineIndex": 192
    },
    {
      "start": 687.31,
      "end": 691.536,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for as our fathers were slothful to give heed to this compass",
      "verse": "37:43",
      "lineIndex": 193
    },
    {
      "start": 691.716,
      "end": 694.92,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "(now these things were temporal) they did not prosper;",
      "verse": "37:43",
      "lineIndex": 194
    },
    {
      "start": 695.1,
      "end": 697.886,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even so it is with things which are spiritual.",
      "verse": "37:43",
      "lineIndex": 195
    },
    {
      "start": 698.566,
      "end": 705.393,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, it is as easy to give heed to the word of Christ, which will point to you a straight course to eternal bliss,",
      "verse": "37:44",
      "lineIndex": 196
    },
    {
      "start": 705.573,
      "end": 709.056,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "as it was for our fathers to give heed to this compass,",
      "verse": "37:44",
      "lineIndex": 197
    },
    {
      "start": 709.236,
      "end": 713.555,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which would point unto them a straight course to the promised land.",
      "verse": "37:44",
      "lineIndex": 198
    },
    {
      "start": 714.235,
      "end": 715.535,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I say,",
      "verse": "37:45",
      "lineIndex": 199
    },
    {
      "start": 715.715,
      "end": 717.898,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "is there not a type in this thing?",
      "verse": "37:45",
      "lineIndex": 200
    },
    {
      "start": 718.078,
      "end": 725.044,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For just as surely as this director did bring our fathers, by following its course, to the promised land,",
      "verse": "37:45",
      "lineIndex": 201
    },
    {
      "start": 725.224,
      "end": 732.051,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "shall the words of Christ, if we follow their course, carry us beyond this vale of sorrow into a far better land of promise.",
      "verse": "37:45",
      "lineIndex": 202
    },
    {
      "start": 732.731,
      "end": 733.846,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O my son,",
      "verse": "37:46",
      "lineIndex": 203
    },
    {
      "start": 734.026,
      "end": 737.788,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "do not let us be slothful because of the easiness of the way;",
      "verse": "37:46",
      "lineIndex": 204
    },
    {
      "start": 737.968,
      "end": 740.197,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for so was it with our fathers;",
      "verse": "37:46",
      "lineIndex": 205
    },
    {
      "start": 740.377,
      "end": 742.606,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for so was it prepared for them,",
      "verse": "37:46",
      "lineIndex": 206
    },
    {
      "start": 742.786,
      "end": 745.015,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that if they would look they might live;",
      "verse": "37:46",
      "lineIndex": 207
    },
    {
      "start": 745.195,
      "end": 746.774,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even so it is with us.",
      "verse": "37:46",
      "lineIndex": 208
    },
    {
      "start": 746.954,
      "end": 748.672,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "The way is prepared,",
      "verse": "37:46",
      "lineIndex": 209
    },
    {
      "start": 748.852,
      "end": 751.174,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and if we will look we may live forever.",
      "verse": "37:46",
      "lineIndex": 210
    },
    {
      "start": 751.854,
      "end": 753.247,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, my son,",
      "verse": "37:47",
      "lineIndex": 211
    },
    {
      "start": 753.427,
      "end": 756.213,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "see that ye take care of these sacred things,",
      "verse": "37:47",
      "lineIndex": 212
    },
    {
      "start": 756.393,
      "end": 758.994,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, see that ye look to God and live.",
      "verse": "37:47",
      "lineIndex": 213
    },
    {
      "start": 759.174,
      "end": 760.799,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Go unto this people",
      "verse": "37:47",
      "lineIndex": 214
    },
    {
      "start": 760.979,
      "end": 762.419,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and declare the word,",
      "verse": "37:47",
      "lineIndex": 215
    },
    {
      "start": 762.599,
      "end": 763.853,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and be sober.",
      "verse": "37:47",
      "lineIndex": 216
    },
    {
      "start": 764.033,
